 subject="MacPorts build of git-annex"
 date="2026-11-03T04:07:47Z"
 content="""
As additional context, it looks like [MacPorts does now have a build of git-annex](https://ports.macports.org/port/git-annex/details/), although it seems infrequently updated (`Version: 10.20260316`, `Updated: 7 months, 2 weeks ago`).  It too doesn't support macOS 10.15 / Catalina any longer.

But maybe it'd be worth linking from the [OSX page](https://git-annex.branchable.com/install/OSX/) if you think \"a build, but maybe old\" is worth users considering.  (By contrast I think HomeBrew has active git-annex users, as it seems to get updated/rebuilt fairly soon after a new release.)

Ewen
"""]]
